flowchart LR
  S[Sensory Input<br/>Sight / Hearing / Touch /<br/>Smell / Taste] --> D[1. Detection]
  D --> P[2. Perception]
  P --> DM[3. Decision Making<br/><i>Working Memory</i>]
  DM --> A[4. Action<br/>Response Executed]
  A --> F[5. Feedback]
  F -.alters action.-> DM
  LTM[(Long-Term Memory)] <--> DM
  STM[(Short-Term Memory)] <--> DM
